  "details": "The newest update made the banners above nameplates follow the opacity setting of the nameplate.\n\nThis makes the banner invisible at 0% opacity, which makes you unable to hide the nameplate background but still see the banner. 0% opacity is useless for me because of this.\n\nBanner opacity should follow how icon opacity works - still being slightly visible at 0%. If I wanted to hide the banner there already exists a toggle to hide it fully.\n\nAdditionally - banners and icons should go 100% opacity when the Quick Menu is opened.",
